abstract: >-
  Reusable Blender assets for optical schematics, with a setup-to-Blender
  agent and step-by-step documentation. Original code is licensed under MIT;
  original models, figures, and documentation are licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  The example is a later reconstruction of the optical setup described in
  https://doi.org/10.1103/6ftp-svh8; these Blender models were not used in that paper.
